  "title": "Paprika Pork Stew",
  "description": "Start this slow cooker pork stew in the morning and all you&#39;ll need to do before dinner is make the sauce and let it thicken for 10 minutes with the meat and vegetables.",
  "authors": [
    "DARKSACRIFICE"
  ],
